    {
      "text": "Lolly is a platform-agnostic engine that runs the same render path across several shells «web PWA, Tauri desktop/mobile, CLI, TUI».",
      "start": 57.7,
      "end": 69.9
    },
    {
      "text": "Tools are data, not bundled code - a manifest plus a template plus optional hooks - so new tools ship without an app update.",
      "start": 70.25,
      "end": 80.625
    },
    {
      "text": "Start with the Overview for the architecture, then follow the track that fits what you're building.",
      "start": 80.975,
